---
description: "Dev server ownership: the user runs dev servers; the agent never starts them."
globs: "**/*"
---

## Dev server ownership (mandatory)

- Do **not** run `npm run dev`, `next dev`, `dotnet run`, `dotnet watch`, or start any long-running dev server process.
- Ask the user to run the dev server locally and provide the URL/port when runtime verification is needed.
- It is ok to run non-server commands like `npm run lint`, `npm run build`, `dotnet build`.
